FantasyBot ports LaLigaApp's B2C refresh-token flow (src/services/authService.js,
src/stores/authStore.js), its API endpoint map (src/services/api.js) and its
response adapters (src/services/responseAdapters.js) to Python, and its
futbolfantasy.com lineup parser (src/services/onceParser.js).
This attribution does not imply endorsement by the original authors.

Outside data, each optional:
- Football data provided by the Football-Data.org API (https://www.football-data.org),
  with your own token.
- Match odds from The Odds API (https://the-odds-api.com), with your own key.
- Probable lineups read from futbolfantasy.com team pages.
